		{"id":"cf0d03b74ea6cea2","type":"text","text":"## Belief minimal\nclaim + confidence.\nProvenance et validation dans les traces ; aucun champ additionnel imposé au belief.","x":340,"y":460,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"4"},
